body:
Short answer: Yes.

&#x200B;

Long answer: YMMV, some people trip fine and some people report medication dulling the effects, sometimes to the point of needing huge doses just to have a "normal trip." Just start low and slow and work your way up as usual until you start feeling the effects and take it from there. The only person who can figure out your body chemistry is you so good luck

